{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>這款限時免費的《Clap Camera》App，絕對是您告別手忙腳亂拍照體驗的最佳選擇。無論您是獨自旅行，想在美景前留下自己的身影；還是與朋友合影，卻苦於每次都要跑回手機前設定；甚至想錄製健身影片或創作社群內容，它都能完美解決這些痛點。透過簡單的拍手或彈指，就能輕鬆啟動計時器，捕捉最精彩的瞬間，現在就立即下載，享受前所未有的自由拍攝體驗。</p>\n\n<h2>擺脫遙控器，輕聲一拍即捕捉完美瞬間</h2>\n<p>《Clap Camera》讓您無需觸碰手機，只需將裝置固定於腳架或任何平面，然後走入畫面中，輕輕拍手或彈指，就能自動觸發倒數計時並拍照。它支援前後鏡頭，並提供可調整的倒數計時器與連拍模式，無論是捕捉完美姿勢，還是錄製一系列動作，都能輕鬆搞定，介面簡潔直觀，上手毫無難度。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-123-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-124-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-125-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-126-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-127-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-128-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Auto Photo: Clap Camera Timer</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-20T01:31:43.444331+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":393,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}